 B)
DESCRIPTION:The City of College Station will host a ribbon-cutting ceremo
 ny on Tuesday\, August 18\, at 11:30 a.m. to celebrate the installation o
 f the new library book drop at Tower Point H-E-B\, located at 949 William
  D. Fitch Parkway\, College Station\, TX 77845 (between the H-E-B Gas Sta
 tion and Pharmacy). Feel free to join if you can as we celebrate this exc
 iting addition to library services in our community!\n\nHere are the thre
 e convenient locations for the book drops throughout College Station:\n\n
   * Lincoln Recreation Center\n  * Meyer Senior & Community Center\n  * T
 ower Point H-E-B\n\nThese additional book return locations make it even e
 asier for residents to return library materials closer to where they live
 \, work\, and shop.\n\nThis celebration is open to the public.
