SUMMARY: Community Benefits Assistance at Your Library (LJRL) - Register
DESCRIPTION:Beginning in June 2026\, the Bryan + College Station Public L
 ibrary System will partner with the Brazos Valley Food Bank to assist lib
 rary patrons with applying for and renewing state benefit programs.\n\nPr
 ograms Available:\n\n  * SNAP/TSAP\n  * Medicaid\n  * TANF\n  * Healthy T
 exas Women\n  * Medicare Savings Program\n  * And more\n\nYou can find a 
 complete list of available programs at: Your Texas Benefits - Learn https
 ://url.us.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/J1SxCyPkv8hyVMBMSMhvUxuZSI?domain=yourt
 exasbenefits.com .\n\nTo help prepare for your appointment\, please revie
 w the required documents here: H1858.pdf https://url.us.m.mimecastprotect
 .com/s/kBaCCxkjrGfQNAWAS8fVUyHMZm?domain=hhs.texas.gov\n\nService Locatio
 ns & Schedule:\n\n  * Larry J. Ringer Library\, 1st & 3rd Fridays\, 10 AM
  - 3 PM\n  * Clara B. Mounce Public Library\, 2nd & 4th Fridays\, 10 AM -
  3 PM\n\nPlease note: Services will not be available on June 19 and July 
 3\, 2026.\n\nWalk-ins are welcome\, and advance registration is encourage
 d. To register\, click the RSVP button in the top right corner.\n\nFor mo
 re information\, please visit Brazos Valley Food Bank https://url.us.m.mi
 mecastprotect.com/s/VLPcCzplwmumV2j2CgiLU9hCRc?domain=bvfb.org .\n\n  * S
