SUMMARY: BCS Public Libraries 2026 Author Series: Annie Hartnett Author V
 isit (CBMPL) - RSVP starting July 21
DESCRIPTION:RSVPs for this event have closed. Walk-ins are welcome\, but 
 admission will be available only after all guests with RSVPs have been se
 ated and space permits. Doors will open 30 minutes before the event\, so 
 please arrive early.\n\nThe 2026 Author Series https://www.bcslibrary.org
 /2025-2026-author-series/ presents Annie Hartnett https://www.anniehartne
 tt.com/ \, the bestselling author of three novels: Rabbit Cake https://bc
 sdmc.overdrive.com/media/3036789 \, Unlikely Animals https://bcsdmc.overd
 rive.com/media/6331865 \, and The Road to Tender Hearts https://bcsdmc.ov
 erdrive.com/media/11138961 .\n\nThe Road to Tender Hearts https://bcsdmc.
 overdrive.com/media/11138961 is a national bestseller\, USA Today Bestsel
 ler\, and the winner of the 2025 New England Book Award for fiction. Unli
 kely Animals https://bcsdmc.overdrive.com/media/6331865 was the winner of
  the 2023 Julia Ward Howe prize for fiction. Rabbit Cake https://bcsdmc.o
 verdrive.com/media/3036789 was a Best Book of the Year at Kirkus Reviews\
 , Book Riot\, The Chicago Review of Books\, and Minnesota Public Radio.\n
 \nAnnie co-runs Accountability Workshops for writers with Tessa Fontaine.
  Annie Hartnett lives in Massachusetts.\n\nThe event will include present
 ation\, Q&A and book signing. The first 50 people to register and attend 
 the event in person will receive a free copy of the book The Road to Tend
 er Hearts https://bcsdmc.overdrive.com/media/11138961 .\n\nBooks will be 
 for sale onsite by Hyperbole Bookstore https://hyperbolebookstore.com/ wi
 th 10% of proceeds to the Friends.\n\nFor more information\, email Mounce
  Library https://weblink.bryantx.gov/Forms/lcAHV or call (979) 209-5600.\
 n\n  * Sign up for our newsletter here. https://visitor.r20.constantconta
 ct.com/manage/optin?v=001njYGB35hzW08yjx9K9H_gU70BZ6SKD2SfAtH5JbP4-hKd25v
 ULJv4UhR6tH-qIgYlnf0yaupsWvaT4yl9UfcU_DQYTkq2KmHjq_ND7nxgR_A_Q3uJkpZ3QR9V
 YAq-sqcc2oLcsbmz2O4_ivTorI01NZ_vuvRLC_c\n\n
CATEGORIES:Adult
